 *
 * Defined in @theme block so Tailwind auto-generates utility classes.
 *
 * Spacing/Sizing (--phi): Generates w-*, h-*, p-*, m-*, gap-*, etc. utilities
 *   Example: --phi → gap-phi, p-phi, w-phi
