 * Fonts (--font-*): Generates font-* utilities
 *   Example: --font-sans → font-sans
 *
 * Colors (--color-*): Generates bg-*, text-*, border-*, etc. utilities
 *   Example: --color-blue-500 → bg-blue-500, text-blue-500, border-blue-500
